# Follow the loop

When the task adds a feature, follow [follow-the-loop](mdc:.cursor/skills/follow-the-loop/SKILL.md) before editing product code.

- Scaffold `.context-rot-guard/features/<slug>/` with `python3 -m context_rot_guard feature start` (or write `acceptance.json` to that schema) before implementation.
- The check command is the oracle. "Looks done" is not a check.
- On red, correct that unit only. Stop on attempt cap or identical red output instead of polishing.
